Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But every single Black
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}artist need to be on Tidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも黒人アーティストは　全員Tidalに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}入るべきなんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And every single Black
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}artist need to wear Yeezy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}黒人アーティストは全員
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Yeezyを着るべきだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And if Cedric, the head of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Balenciaga, talk left or right to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Balenciagaのトップの　Cedricが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺に妙な口をきいたら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}we need to be able to turn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the switch off on Balenciaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Balenciagaのスイッチを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:15.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}切れるようにしないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And if he talk right to me and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}us, we turn the switch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちにまともな口をきくなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}スイッチを入れる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}We have to come together as a bloc,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Claude Andersonが言ったように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}as Claude Anderson said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}We have to be a bloc.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちは一つの“ブロック”に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:25.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ならなきゃいけない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So this time, say, if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だから今回は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}don't... let's say, just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}in our wildest dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}もし俺が…　万が一だぞ　Yeが大統領に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Ye doesn't become president.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}なれなかったとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Hip-hop is a tribe by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ヒップホップは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それ自体が一つの部族なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, so everyone is hip-hop. Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そう　みんながヒップホップ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だから一つになる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:39.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}we come together. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:39.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}That's a race itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:39.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それだけだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:39.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}それ自体が一つの人種なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Hip-hop is a race.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ヒップホップは人種だって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's what I've been trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}to tell you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺がずっと言ってるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:43.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Hip-hop has no color.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:43.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ヒップホップに肌の色はない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}What are we doing with hip-hop?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Hip-hop, if you say it's not a race,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ヒップホップで　何をするかだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}人種じゃないって言うなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}at least it's a people, just like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}how Jewish people are a people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}少なくとも一つの“民”だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ユダヤ人が一つの民であるようにな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, hip-hop against everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ヒップホップ対全員だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And we're making our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}people do our own thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、俺たちの仲間に　自分たちのことを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}やらせるんだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そうだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's time for us to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}A tremendous name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}やる時が来たんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}“Tremendous”な名前だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I feel like Drink Champs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}is doing that immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Drink Champsは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}今まさにそれをやってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}right now. I feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}we're doing it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちは今やってるんだ
